        <mxCell id="use1-content1" value="• Unsupervised Learning (Isolation Forest)&#xa;• 基线建立 → 偏差识别&#xa;• 减少规则维护成本" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
