          <mxGeometry x="130" y="990" width="1000" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ch1-title" value="对抗性攻击 (Adversarial Attack):" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#DC2626;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1046" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ch1-content" value="• 攻击者故意污染训练数据 | 对抗样本绕过检测&#xa;• 应对: 对抗训练 (Adversarial Training)" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1072" width="1000" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ch2-title" value="数据质量问题:" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#DC2626;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1120" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ch2-content" value="• 标注数据不足/错误 | 类别不平衡 (恶意样本少)&#xa;• 应对: 数据增强 + SMOTE + 迁移学习" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1146" width="1000" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ch3-title" value="可解释性 (Explainability):" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#DC2626;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1194" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ch3-content" value="• 黑盒模型难以调试 | 误报无法分析根因&#xa;• 应对: SHAP / LIME + 规则混合" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1220" width="1000" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ch4-title" value="模型漂移 (Model Drift):" style="text;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#DC2626;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1268" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ch4-content" value="• 攻击手法持续演进 | 模型性能衰减&#xa;• 应对: 持续学习 + A/B测试 + 定期重训" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
